#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1816
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring Login Classes"
msgstr "设置登入类别"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1822
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the traditional method, login classes and the resource limits to apply to "
"a login class are defined in [.filename]#/etc/login.conf#.  Each user "
"account can be assigned to a login class, where `default` is the default "
"login class.  Each login class has a set of login capabilities associated "
"with it.  A login capability is a `_name_=_value_` pair, where _name_ is a "
"well-known identifier and _value_ is an arbitrary string which is processed "
"accordingly depending on the _name_."
msgstr "在传统方法中，登录类及应用于登录类的资源限制定义在 [.filename]#/etc/login.conf# 中。每个用户帐户都可以分配到一个登录类，其中 `default` 是默认登录类。每个登录类都关联一组登录能力。登录能力是一个 `__name__=__value__` 对，其中 __name__ 是众所周知的标识符，而 __value__ 是根据 __name__ 进行相应处理的任意字符串。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1824
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The first step to configure a resource limit will be to open [.filename]#/"
"etc/login.conf# by executing the following command:"
msgstr ""
"每次修改 <filename>/etc/login.conf</filename> 之后，必须通过执行以下命令更新 "
"<filename>/etc/login.conf.db</filename>："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1828
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# ee /etc/login.conf\n"
msgstr "# ee /etc/login.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1832
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Then locate the section for the user class to be modified.  In this example, "
"let's assume the user class is named `limited`, create it in case it does "
"not exist."
msgstr "然后找到要修改的用户类所在的部分。在此示例中，假设用户类名为 `limited`；如果该类不存在，则创建它。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1838
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"limited:\\ <.>\n"
"        :maxproc=50:\\ <.>\n"
"        :tc=default: <.>\n"
msgstr "limited:\\ <.>\n        :maxproc=50:\\ <.>\n        :tc=default: <.>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1841
#, fuzzy
msgid "Name of the user class."
msgstr "用户类的名称。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1842
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of processes (maxproc) to 50 for users in the "
"`limited` class."
msgstr "为 `limited` 类中的用户将进程最大数量（maxproc）设置为 50。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/security/_index.adoc:1843
